  "prefLabel": "Phy 401.12 General supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 401.12 “General supervision\" means \"general supervision\" as defined in RSA 328-A:2, V, namely, \"that the physical therapist is not required to be on-site for direction and supervision, but must be available at least by telecommunications.\"\n\nSource. #9456, eff 4-17-09; renumbered by #10061 (from Phy 401.09); ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17",
